KPI-EDGAR test slice
====================

kpi_edgar_test_slice.jsonl and schema.json are derived from KPI-EDGAR:
https://github.com/tobideusser/kpi-edgar

KPI-EDGAR is released under the MIT License. Copyright (c) 2022 Tobias Deusser,
Syed Musharraf Ali, Lars Hillebrand. The licence text is in the LICENSE.md file
of that repository. The sentences come from public 10-K filings on SEC EDGAR.

Paper: T. Deusser, S. M. Ali, L. Hillebrand, D. Nurchalifah, B. Jacob,
C. Bauckhage, R. Sifa. "KPI-EDGAR: A Novel Dataset and Accompanying Metric for
Relation Extraction from Financial Documents." ICMLA 2022.
https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.09163

Changes made:
- Only sentences of the KPI-EDGAR test split that have at least one entity, and
  no longer than 600 characters, are used. 100 sentences are kept, chosen with a
  fixed seed by taking turns across filings.
- Entity spans changed from word indexes to character offsets in the sentence
  text. Each entity carries the exact text of its span.
- The entity labels increase-py and decrease-py are written increase_py and
  decrease_py.
- The relation "matches" is renamed RELATED_VALUE, because MATCHES names the
  entity resolution edge in agrag. The relation has no direction. The schema
  lists each entity pair in both orders.
- Entity descriptions in schema.json are written from Table I of the paper.
- Data is stored as agrag ExtractionResult objects. Run
  build_kpi_edgar_fixture.py against a clone of KPI-EDGAR to rebuild the files.
